  full model), starting at the human mean gaze lead; the pinned version is
  kept as fixed_horizon_human.
- cluster/cycles_job.sh chained after the fit for every mpcc run;
  submit_cycles.sh runs it on finished runs. quantify_gaze_cycles.py:
  --config-dir/--quant-dir/--config/--letters/--workers (parallel by
  participant, identical rows) and two lookahead-specific sections in the
  stats (fixation-onset lead vs width, saccades per trial vs width).

